          "filename": "Manx Electric Railway at Ramsey terminus (geograph 5075011).jpg",
          "caption": "Manx Electric Railway at Ramsey terminus. The track layout at Ramsey doesn't allow for the usual method of running the motor car round the trailer ready for the return journey. The motor car, no.21, has been detached from the trailer and will come back towards the photographer on the track adjacent to the trailer. This will then be allowed to roll down under gravity to the end of the line, where the motor car will reverse back onto it and be coupled up again.",
